&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nielsen has suggested that the peristyle of the Royal palace V, which is unpaved, was possibly a garden, watered by cisterns (Fig. 1).&lt;/p&gt;
